  "description": "GG TV：本机运行的无限画布 AI 图片 / 视频创作工具（火山引擎 Seedream、Seedance），支持视频改写。Local infinite-canvas studio for AI image and video generation with Volcengine Ark (Seedream, Seedance) and motion-preserving video rewrite. Windows.",
  "keywords": [
    "infinite-canvas",
    "ai-video",
    "ai-image",
    "video-generation",
    "image-generation",
    "seedance",
    "seedream",
    "doubao",
    "volcengine",
    "volcengine-ark",
    "video-rewrite",
    "video-to-video",
    "motion-transfer",
    "comfyui",
    "video-depth-anything",
    "react-flow",
    "windows",
    "local-first"
  ],
  "homepage": "https://github.com/c2247189334/ggtv-canvas#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/c2247189334/ggtv-canvas.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/c2247189334/ggtv-canvas/issues"
  },
  "license": "SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "vite build",
    "pack": "node scripts/pack-release.mjs",
    "smoke": "node scripts/smoke-release.mjs",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "test": "npm run test:web && npm run test:server",
    "test:web": "vitest run src",
    "test:server": "node --test \"server/**/*.test.mjs\"",
    "start": "node server/start.mjs",
    "fake": "vite build && node server/start.mjs --fake --port=5291"
